SUMMARY:Beirut Nights In Presents: Beirut To Miami
LOCATION:ZeyZey Miami\, 353 Northeast 61st Street\, Miami\, FL 33137\, USA
DESCRIPTION:Beirut Nights In Presents: Beirut to Miami! Immerse yourself in
  the diverse rhythms of Arabic\, French\, Latin\, House\, and other global
  genres\, capturing the essence of Beirut's cosmopolitan allure right in t
 he heart of Miami! Picture a city that has endured the tests of time\, our
  party seeks to encapsulate its resilience and vivacity in the face agains
 t all odds. Amidst the turmoil and uncertainty of conflict\, Beirutis have
  always found solace and strength in their vibrant nightlife\, turning nig
 hts of darkness into moments of light and celebration. The cosmopolitan na
 ture of Beirut's nightlife is a tapestry woven with the threads of diverse
  cultures\, traditions and modern influences. It is a reflection of the ci
 ty's historical role as a crossroads of civilizations\, where East meets W
 est and tradition combine seamlessly with contemporary trends. Step into B
 eirut's nightlife\, and you'll find yourself immersed in a vibrant mosaic 
 of sights\, sounds\, and experiences that celebrate the city's rich multic
 ultural heritage. Music: Anthony Raad & Mark Azar Doors open @ 11 PM 21+ N
 o refunds\nTags: afro house\, arabic house\, arabic pop\, indie/alternativ
 e\nPresented by: BEIRUT NIGHTS IN\nTickets: General Admission - Early Bird
  $30 (sold out)\, VIP Table for 6 People - $750 Minimum Spend $150\, Gener
 al Admission - Tier 2 $35\, VIP Table for 8 People - $1000 Minimum Spend $
 200\, VIP Table for 10 People - $1500 Minimum Spend $250\nhttps://shotgun.
 live/en/events/beiruttomiami1\nhttps://buy.tablelist.com/e/3f6b13fd5414726
 8\nhttps://buy.tablelist.com/e/685c26ba1136eddc\nhttps://calendar.zeyzeymi
 ami.com/shows/beirut-nights-in-14-nov\nhttps://calendar.zeyzeymiami.com/sh
 ows/dj-paypal-14-nov\nhttps://calendar.zeyzeymiami.com/shows/tul8te-world-
